        c("control.nav.service.reload", "Reload a service", "In the menu of a service in the top row (right-click or double-click): loads the open service's page again. It is off for a service that is not open. It is the same as Reload in the Services menu.", ["Top bar"]),
        c("control.services.pillmenu", "Service pill menu", "The small menu of a service in the top row, opened by right-click or double-click. It offers Reload, Pin or Unpin, for a pinned service Move Left and Move Right, and Clear Data. Double-clicking only opens this menu; it never changes a pin by itself.", ["Top bar"]),
