        c("control.services.clearData", "Clear a service's data (top bar)", "In the menu of a service in the top row (right-click or double-click): after a confirmation that names the service, signs you out of that one service in StreamSetu and removes its cookies and saved site data. Other services, playlists and settings are not touched. It is the same as Clear Data on the service's card in Settings.", ["Top bar"]),
