        c("control.settings.servicesKeepPlaying", "Keep services playing in the background", "A switch above the service cards. On (the default), a streaming service keeps playing when you switch to another service or another screen, and stops only when something else starts playing; this works as far as macOS and the web engine allow when the service is not on screen, and is not guaranteed. Off, switching away pauses the service.", ["Settings", "Privacy", "Streaming services"]),
